{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adfd9ae8a3fac031d3b8b470a52a709a23d4d6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> is to be chosen in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Coordinate_plane\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Coordinate plane\">coordinate plane</a> so that it is equally distant from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=X-axis\" title=\"X-axis\">x-axis</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Y-axis\" title=\"Y-axis\">y-axis</a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54abe49c29fdbf920d53d4890237037c2625a8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/e/59e2c62fc669ce442f0fe28004eeb4b715b45344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }\\sqrt{2}-1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 2-\\sqrt{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\text{Not uniquely determined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"611\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-axis intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, while the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54abe49c29fdbf920d53d4890237037c2625a8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> intersects the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c67f1e6c098104b1cb8f1cdd6bb16f689ac3e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-axis at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef68f274ec95f4a8f94eebff49accdcf689ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/714aaa6297de408b5421afc1b5d3edad72ecdb59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A (0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74da1518954e4ee0464cdb77589f7fb6b8ca9c0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B (2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edfa3bb0892c00b76c2b15a1c03d6e0d23089a76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C (0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> be these three points.  Then the incenter and the three excenters of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> must all be equidistant from all three of these lines.  Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />-excenter has a negative <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinate while the incenter and other two excenters have positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinates, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea52efcecd614482427ff9e63e3fdea43174b80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\mathbf{E})\\ \\mathrm{not\\ uniquely\\ determined}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"241\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/in